#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:5
#: 3bf00c053db04f4b87788732515c1536
msgid "Traditional Helicopter - Pre-Flight Testing"
msgstr "传统直升机——飞前测试"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:7
#: b03f82339d894c1286330573ed891326
msgid "Before your first flight, please follow these pre-flight checks:"
msgstr "在首次飞行前，请按照以下飞前检查项进行检查："

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:11
#: 33ea6b901999420fb94d9ec8fc2bcd6b
msgid ""
"The drive should be disconnected on electric helicopters when they are being"
" handled. An accidental startup can cause serious injury."
msgstr "操作电动直升机时应断开驱动连接。意外启动可能造成严重伤害。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:14
#: c705a32b26f4406383d6f725c5b8c65d
msgid "Ensure the USB connector is disconnected from the autopilot"
msgstr "确保 USB 连接线已从飞控上断开"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:15
#: 3e1265ff14494248b326ae532fd5f5ad
msgid "Connect the battery to power the autopilot and servos"
msgstr "连接电池为飞控和舵机供电"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:18
#: 6cc59fe46cdd45c48f9206fdbd160753
msgid "Test leaning the helicopter in Stabilize mode"
msgstr "在 Stabilize 模式下测试直升机倾斜响应"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:20
#: d65c43579a95444e890abc86db317fe0
msgid ""
"By hand, roll the helicopter to the left. The swash plate should lean to the"
" right."
msgstr "用手将直升机向左横滚，倾斜盘应向右倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:22
#: 021a19c839c546eba981964972bb9606
msgid ""
"Roll the helicopter to the right. The swash plate should lean to the left."
msgstr "将直升机向右横滚，倾斜盘应向左倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:24
#: 074b87229fda45dcaad047a875bed0c2
msgid ""
"Pitch the helicopter down (i.e. nose down). The swash plate should lean "
"backwards."
msgstr "将直升机向前俯仰（即机头向下），倾斜盘应向后倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:26
#: 584b3d14150b4e08af795b95616bc4f7
msgid ""
"Pitch the helicopter up (i.e. nose up). The swash plate should lean "
"forwards."
msgstr "将直升机向后俯仰（即机头向上），倾斜盘应向前倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:28
#: 8f8b0b1a88764f9791cd9ab34a79bb6f
msgid ""
"Rotate the helicopter quickly clockwise - the tail servo should move as if "
"you had pushed the rudder control left (i.e. it should try to fight against "
"the rotation)"
msgstr "快速顺时针旋转直升机——尾舵机应像您将方向舵向左推一样移动（即它应尝试对抗旋转）"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:31
#: c9f51a56a8c74b00942c3dd9dd9eb0a8
msgid ""
"Rotate the helicopter quickly counter-clockwise - the tail servo should move"
" as if you had pushed the rudder control right (i.e. it should try to fight "
"against the rotation)"
msgstr "快速逆时针旋转直升机——尾舵机应像您将方向舵向右推一样移动（即它应尝试对抗旋转）"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:34
#: 79002f61e9814fe4bf3a05f41bf4edfa
msgid ""
"Next rotate the helicopter slowly. You should find that in a certain "
"direction the rudder stays in the middle."
msgstr "接下来缓慢旋转直升机，您会发现在某个方向上方向舵保持在中位。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:38
#: 13724d5a85d04b3a86588d31d03202e0
msgid "Test the transmitter in Stabilize mode"
msgstr "在 Stabilize 模式下测试遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:40
#: 4658fadfa3cb44dc981e6caa24efa2ac
msgid ""
"Using the transmitter, move the roll stick to the left. The swashplate "
"should lean slightly to the left."
msgstr "使用遥控器，将横滚摇杆向左推，倾斜盘应略微向左倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:42
#: 989e150981af415eb19baea28728d5c6
msgid ""
"move the roll stick to the right. The swashplate should lean slightly to the"
" right."
msgstr "将横滚摇杆向右推，倾斜盘应略微向右倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:44
#: a1b58ed424944bd9b646afa47b5817b0
msgid ""
"Move the pitch stick forward. The swashplate should lean slightly forward."
msgstr "将俯仰摇杆向前推，倾斜盘应略微向前倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:46
#: 28b854f4a6744aa58c02d39ed9caae0f
msgid ""
"Move the pitch stick back. The swashplate should lean slightly backwards."
msgstr "将俯仰摇杆向后拉，倾斜盘应略微向后倾斜。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-preflight-testing.rst:48
#: 94e02bc610844907abcdc93b76a6dcbb
msgid ""
"Move the yaw stick to the left or right. The tail should move in the same "
"direction (and about the same amount) as when you are in manual mode."
msgstr "将偏航摇杆向左或向右推，机尾应向同方向移动（移动量约与手动模式相同）。"
